# N = 6 control of lem:cube-moving-subset-curves: codim W_3 >= 2 fails at N = 6 (involution divisor), so for
# generic b at least one of C_1, C_3 fails (interior), (boundary) or (escape).  Interior test: gcd of
# A = Res_z(Rt', Rt'') and B = Res_z(Rt, Rt'') over s; degree bounds deg_s Q * (2 deg R - 2) = 120*178, 288*178.
curveR 6 190 115 100000 22000 0 0 0 0 0 0 2 3/7 -5/3 11/4 -1 7/2
curveR 6 190 115 111000 52000 0 0 0 0 0 0 2 3/7 -5/3 11/4 -1 7/2
